  Syntax:
  [[[Display Name|||text_options|||Default Val|||Other Val|||Another Val...]]]
  text_options is fixed; this allows us to add other types of param choosers in future.

  If you want to mention the same key different times, you can use the shorthand [[[Display Name]]]. Each key will be edited together.

  E.g.
  <h1 style='color: [[[Header Color|||text_options|||blue|||red|||green]]]'>Welcome to the app</h1> <h2 style='color: [[[Header Color]]]'>Enjoy your stay</h2>

  Will convert into this edit by default: <h1 style='color: blue'>Welcome to the app</h1> <h2 style='color: blue'>Enjoy your stay</h2>

